# Test corpus provenance

The 35 `voc_<identifier>.txt` / `res_<identifier>.txt` pairs other than Arabic are copied without content changes, after decompressing `.gz` files where needed, from https://github.com/snowballstem/snowball-data/tree/019921c3a41c2b70063ee3feb215a00c8e594597 .

Commit: 019921c3a41c2b70063ee3feb215a00c8e594597 (2026-10-16).
Algorithms: Snowball 3.2.0 (2026-10-17).

General terms are in `COPYING`; corpus-specific terms and provenance are in `COPYING_<identifier>`. `LICENSE` contains the GPLv3 text for the Arabic corpus. Corpora are used only in tests and are not included in the npm package.

Local identifiers and upstream directories:

- `ar`: the retained 91,962-word corpus from release 2.1.1, with every result verified against the official Snowball 3.2.0 C implementation. Provenance and GPLv3+: `COPYING_ar`, `LICENSE`. The full upstream corpus exceeds 9 million lines and is not copied into this repository.
